ASEZ 웹사이트》.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=ASEZ+%EC%9B%B9%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8&amp;rft.atitle=ASEZ+%EC%86%8C%EA%B0%9C&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fasez.org%2Fko%2Fabout-asez%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%A0%9C%EB%A1%AC+%EA%B8%80%EB%A0%8C%EA%B3%BC+%ED%95%A8%EA%BB%98%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94+ASEZ+%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%B4%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://watv.org/ko/asez-global-summit-2019/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">2019 ASEZ 국제 정상회의</a>. 《하나님의교회 세계복음선교협회 웹사이트》.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84%EB%B3%B5%EC%9D%8C%EC%84%A0%EA%B5%90%ED%98%91%ED%9A%8C+%EC%9B%B9%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8&amp;rft.atitle=2019+ASEZ+%EA%B5%AD%EC%A0%9C+%EC%A0%95%EC%83%81%ED%9A%8C%EC%9D%98&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwatv.org%2Fko%2Fasez-global-summit-2019%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%A0%9C%EB%A1%AC+%EA%B8%80%EB%A0%8C%EA%B3%BC+%ED%95%A8%EA%BB%98%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94+ASEZ+%EA%B0%84%EB%8B%B4%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"cog-related-site part-t\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"site-img site-img1\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://watv.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">watv-img1</a></div>\n<div class=\"site-info\">\n<div>하나님의 교회 대표 사이트</div>\n<div class=\"cog-tag\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://watv.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WATV.ORG</a></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<di